knowledge "curriculum-math"

# THE PLAN of the mathematics course, by level: L0 the picture of a number,
# L1 a function and a construction, L2 exactness, matrices, statistics and
# probability, L3 money, optimisation and Tukey, then the derivative that
# checks a formula and the identity that is not a self-check. Every planned
# chapter trains a skill of the program; the skills this course would mint of
# its own are asked of the education plane (MATH-SKILLS-01).

